{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And they could not speak to him peaceably.</b> They were able, but they were not permitted — so that all the evil report he brought upon them would not be verified, and their father would say that out of hatred he spoke all this. Therefore they were not permitted to speak before their father in terms that would lead to peace; hence it says 'peaceably.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :kli-yakar, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:32:05.857405059Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}